HB0285 Pesticide warning labels.
Sponsored By: Representative(s) Strock and Campbell, K and
Senator(s) Boner
AN ACT relating to public health and safety; providing standards for a pesticide
manufacturer's or seller's duty to warn consumers or the public about pesticide
risks as specified; and providing for an effective date.
